 Hello,

no switches on the graphic card.
1. install the OPEN3D Software
2. You must edit the file:
 /usr/dt/config/Xservers

:0   Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X :0 -nice -2 -screen 1280

3. then restart the Xserver
/sbin/init.d/xlogin stop
login as root and start the Xserver
/sbin/init.d/xlogin start

That's all!

