1   0   1   0   1024x768   70
0   1   1   0   1024x768   72
1   1   1   0   1024x864   60
0   0   0   1   1024x768   60
1   0   0   1   800x600    72
0   1   0   1   800x600    60
1   1   0   1   640x480    72
0   0   1   1   640x480    60
1   0   1   1   1280x1024  75
0   1   1   1   1280x1024  60
1   1   1   1   Reserved

SW1 is the switch closest to the stereo cable port.

