> Is there a way to reset the keyboard and mouse on a PWS500au w/o
> rebooting?  The keyboard and mouse no longer work and there is a
> background job that I don't want to disturb.  I have tried restarting the
> X server and this does not do the trick.

No.

If it is PS/2 mouse and keyboard (I think they all are), then there's nothing
you can do but to reboot the system. And you must do the hardware reset, not
just software. When a PS/2 device is invalidated, it is not checked/enabled
until hardware check is performed.

