we put these lines in root's crontab file:

0 18 * * 1-5 /sbin/sysconfig -r pwrmgr disk_spindown=1 > /dev/null
30 8 * * 1-5 /sbin/sysconfig -r pwrmgr disk_spindown=0 > /dev/null

alternatively, you could run dxpower.

